# Context.dev

Server-only. `CONTEXT_DEV_API_KEY` never goes to the browser.

Spend credits only to **find LinkedIn `/in/` URLs**. Unipile does name/headline lookup. Do not search again during enrich.

- Wrapper: `lib/context-dev.ts`
- Daily collect: `lib/discover-ph.ts` — **one** `POST /web/search` (1 credit / 10 results). Reuse today’s run. Docs: https://docs.context.dev/api-reference/web-scraping/search
- Daily budget: `CONTEXT_DEV_DAILY_CREDIT_BUDGET` (default 1)
- Disabled (10 credits each): brand retrieve, extract. Do not scrape Product Hunt pages.

Retry 429 only. Do not retry 408/5xx (those can consume another credit). Mock the wrapper in tests.
